    "description": "<p>You watch the thoughts of those you converse with to know whether they are lying or telling the truth.</p><p>For <strong>10 minutes</strong>, you can tell whether a creature you are speaking with is lying, is telling the truth, or is confused.</p><p>All creatures may make an opposed <strong>Willpower</strong> check to resist this effect. You know if a creature succeeded or failed on this check.</p><p>Each extra success extends the duration by <strong>+10 minutes</strong>.</p><p><strong>Effect:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.titan-vttrpg-compendium.effects.ActiveEffect.ZKCGl9BKGZvk2sje]{Truth-Sight}</p>",
